  m_text: '- <indent=4em>can appear on reel 5 only during any spin of Base Games
    (including Re-Spin Feature), not Free Games.</indent>

    - <indent=1em>Multiplier
    Wilds appear in stacks.</indent>

    - <indent=1em>It works as a Wild symbol
    with a random multiplier.</indent>

    - <indent=1em>Like regular Wild Symbols,
    Multiplier Wild Symbols get locked during Re-Spin Feature.</indent>

    - <indent=1em>Re-Spin
    or not, as long as in Base Games, the multipliers of such Wilds are calculated
    by multiplication and are applied to the line wins</indent>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5316d286fa94a894888ee12767189de0, type: 2}
